{
  "schema_version": "source_evidence_index_v1",
  "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
  "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
  "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
  "anchors": [
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0001",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 0,
      "char_end": 9,
      "byte_start": 0,
      "byte_end": 23,
      "exact_text": "《门外那把伞》\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "d997e277cd47325e7822dfd4fc2df047d1890d3d2e7d4b79607c8d47a689dfbc"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0002",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 11,
      "char_end": 36,
      "byte_start": 25,
      "byte_end": 96,
      "exact_text": "凌晨一点二十七分，程雨把最后一个纸箱拖到门口。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "ca66c830d7efbd387c40585f3477e9bcc0c23198f2e72fdeb75e17c39c4176d1"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0003",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 38,
      "char_end": 50,
      "byte_start": 98,
      "byte_end": 130,
      "exact_text": "这套房子她住了六年。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "79e4607cc6bb16d9c9220e589b8a616ffbd5d26db851c508200d36b463206f97"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0004",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 52,
      "char_end": 133,
      "byte_start": 132,
      "byte_end": 371,
      "exact_text": "客厅里已经空得只剩一张折叠椅、一盏落地灯，还有墙角那只没有来得及扔掉的旧花盆。墙上原本挂照片的地方留下几块颜色稍浅的长方形印子，像有什么东西刚刚从这里被拿走。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "cadb5af76b4289062334c843f795042ccedd019e73a2d71d7c547d7445c04d12"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0005",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 135,
      "char_end": 150,
      "byte_start": 373,
      "byte_end": 414,
      "exact_text": "明早九点，中介会来收钥匙。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "61cec64fe553bbdb8576953b7e918743d9de189fb0489f0459893720979dbd36"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0006",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 152,
      "char_end": 170,
      "byte_start": 416,
      "byte_end": 466,
      "exact_text": "过了今晚，这里就和她没有关系了。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "0444d6e58af8e32eacd5da04e7a541f6790b95d33030422eaa2f8c4aa3e4067a"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0007",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 172,
      "char_end": 216,
      "byte_start": 468,
      "byte_end": 596,
      "exact_text": "程雨蹲下来，用胶带封上最后一个箱子。胶带刚扯到一半，门外忽然传来一声很轻的金属碰撞。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "13ce852e6e4df8e64606b9d2db12b5078543022f4545ddb9c1930871c561c8f5"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0008",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 218,
      "char_end": 230,
      "byte_start": 598,
      "byte_end": 630,
      "exact_text": "像钥匙碰到了门把手。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "3babdadd335f2369d6f7cd49c76207c55af6fae2fb93c86092dea7e0b011d1d8"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0009",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 232,
      "char_end": 239,
      "byte_start": 632,
      "byte_end": 649,
      "exact_text": "她停住了。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "ab7860e37cdbd287b64689cf3b8c315742cb54f0ac8009b02d54e18ffe5cca90"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0010",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 241,
      "char_end": 257,
      "byte_start": 651,
      "byte_end": 695,
      "exact_text": "屋里没有开电视，也没有音乐。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "4c45891dc2cc5cfb49b6841b83bba3af8fd2ffad74780fd8fdbf70d2996d3e2c"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0011",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 259,
      "char_end": 282,
      "byte_start": 697,
      "byte_end": 762,
      "exact_text": "楼道里静得能听见感应灯电流发出的细微嗡声。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "bb1dc68b157e8203f4e813efda84c6ee919f2c689dab9301174554d8d979d354"
    },
    {
      "anchor_ref": "E0012",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "unit_type": "SOURCE_BLOCK",
      "source_package_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828",
      "source_version_id": "SRC79f12d1b7f5eb828:V01:d001bab5cc82",
      "source_raw_hash": "d001bab5cc820ae3b99f2f7a43ad2f4022e62073acb036a9c1c0e7d4bb888368",
      "char_start": 284,
      "char_end": 292,
      "byte_start": 764,
      "byte_end": 784,
      "exact_text": "程雨看着门。\r\n",
      "exact_text_sha256": "d8f7768355884d824b971838c326bc859c2641ed1f8e55de00be80c3d7ab37bd"
    }
  ],
